    "TenebresPalierTooltip10":  "A Darkness Imp watches over your progression (10 XP secretly awarded by the GM). +1 Mind black.",
    "TenebresBienfaitTooltip10":"At the 10th point of Darkness, a voice rises from your shadow: an Imp. It can advise you during Invocations and opens the path to conjuring minor Demons (Opalins).",
    "TenebresPalierTooltip20":  "The dreams of the past return under a blood moon. Some particularly harrowing nights: -2 to all physical actions the next day. +1 Mind black.",
    "TenebresBienfaitTooltip20":"Your Imp can evolve using your experience points. +1 stat = 2 XP, +1 skill = 1 XP. Max skills = your INT, max score 5.",
    "TenebresPalierTooltip30":  "A 1st or 2nd Circle Demon bursts from every orifice of the Darkness-bearer to guide (and annoy) them. +1 Body black.",
    "TenebresBienfaitTooltip30":"The Mischievous Demon bursting from your body grants you the key to Invoking Second Circle creatures.",
    "TenebresPalierTooltip40":  "At night, the body follows the outline of shadows while sleepwalking. WIL DIF 20 roll required to avoid falling. +1 Body black.",
    "TenebresPalierTooltip50":  "Nights without real sleep, filled with nightmares and sleepwalking episodes. Sleep is no longer restorative. +1 Mind black.",
    "TenebresPalierTooltip55":  "Animosity manifesting as violence toward a type of individual (opposite sex, Decan, Season, caste\u2026). +1 Mind black.",
    "TenebresPalierTooltip60":  "Libido oriented toward frankly perverse sexual practices (sadism, absurd forms of relationships\u2026). +1 Mind black.",
    "TenebresPalierTooltip65":  "At full moon, an irresistible need to trace shadow patterns in one's flesh with a blade. The pain is enough to disrupt concentration. +1 Mind black.",
    "TenebresPalierTooltip70":  "Hideous demonic double of the Darkness-bearer. Conjuration DIF -5. Can transfer emotions and wounds. +1 Body black.",
    "TenebresBienfaitTooltip70":"The flashes perceived through the Twin's eyes allow you to perceive Darkness more deeply. You can invoke Third Circle Demons.",
    "TenebresPalierTooltip75":  "Obsessed with darkness and shadow, avoids illuminated areas. Vision decreases in full light (no technical consequences). +1 Mind black.",
    "TenebresBienfaitTooltip75":"Vision in total darkness. Develop the 'Sense of Darkness' skill. Penalties from dim or absent lighting are ignored.",
    "TenebresPalierTooltip78":  "Constant sneaky presence (ghost, specter, beast\u2026) generating paranoid hallucinations. Permanent distraction is a fact. +1 Body black.",
    "TenebresBienfaitTooltip78":"You see wandering souls of the dead and can speak with them. Roll Blackness + 1d10 against variable DIF depending on whether the dead person is willing to speak.",
    "TenebresPalierTooltip81":  "All senses altered: darker colors, screams from the Abyss, smell of putrefaction, rancid taste, touch as cold as marble. +1 Body black.",
    "TenebresBienfaitTooltip81":"Roll Blackness + Demonology + 1d10 against DIF 15 to automatically detect any demonic creature. Does not protect against their illusions.",
    "TenebresPalierTooltip84":  "Blood is replaced by a black molasses. The Advocatus Diaboli grows suspicious; Demons won't hesitate to contract directly. +1 Body black.",
    "TenebresPalierTooltip87":  "Monstrous body resembling a Demon. Risk of being mistaken for a fleeing Demon and hunted by the Abyss Minotaurs. +1 Body black.",
    "TenebresPalierTooltip90":  "Recovers 10 Perfidy points, possibly accompanied by the corresponding Afflictions and Boons. (No black bonus.)",
    "TenebresPalierTooltip92":  "Dark growth taking the form of an obsidian face on the body, expressing itself through the mouth. Can be a confidant or annoying passenger. +1 Body black.",
    "TenebresBienfaitTooltip92":"The Siamese's intelligence opens to you the prospects of Invoking Fourth Circle Demons... at your own risk.",
    "TenebresPalierTooltip94":  "Animals react with hostility or fear. In packs or any gathering, they will attack. +1 Mind black.",
    "TenebresPalierTooltip96":  "The shadow no longer obeys the body or light; it acts according to emotions and can simulate shadow objects, attack other shadows. +1 Mind black.",
    "TenebresPalierTooltip98":  "Connected to Darkness by bonds so strong that in danger, a portal to the Abyss opens through the belly. Permanently deforms the body. +1 Body black.",
    "TenebresBienfaitTooltip98":"Your inner portal allows you to call Obsidians, the only type that still eluded you. The Invocation requires encircling your own shadow with black ink.",
    "TenebresPalierTooltip99":  "A High Devil has spotted you and watches closely, placing a physical mark that creates strange deformations in your silhouette. +1 Body black.",
    "TenebresBienfaitTooltip99":"Roll Blackness + Vigilance + 1d10 against DIF 20 to sense Darkness in an object or being. Margin x 10 = accuracy in % (MR 10 = exact figure).",
    "TenebresPalierTooltip100": "Darkness-bearer at maximum potential, called Fallen. A High Devil has an empathic link and can converse telepathically. Most of the time in madness.",
    "TenebresConjLabel":        "Conj.",
    "TenebresEmpLabel":         "Emp.",
    "TenebresEndLabel":         "End.",

